description:
The classical game of chess... now played in the Wild West! Play chess against your friends or versus the computer, unlock new scenarios and chess pieces, and prove yourself to be the wildest gunslinger in the Old West! 

Features:• Play against the computer with 3 different difficult levels;

• Unlock up to 12 beautiful scenarios for you to play in;

• Unlock 2 more Chess Pieces, with more elaborate designs and armor; 

• Play against your friends locally or just have fun against the computer;

• Originally composed soundtrack to get you in the mood.
